&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Microsoft YaHei UI'; font-size:9pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:26pt; font-weight:700; color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;第一步  获取公众号UID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:16pt; color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;1. 启动并登录电脑端微信&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:16pt; color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;2. 单击本页面“开始获取”按钮&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
