&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:16pt; color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;4. 单击本页面“停止获取”按钮&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
